                        "Mid-points $x_i$: $5, 15, 25, 35, 45, 55$.",
                        "Deviations $|x_i - 28|$: $|5 - 28| = 23, |15 - 28| = 13, |25 - 28| = 3, |35 - 28| = 7, |45 - 28| = 17, |55 - 28| = 27$.",
