                        "Combined Variance formula: $\\sigma^2 = \\frac{n_1(\\sigma_1^2 + d_1^2) + n_2(\\sigma_2^2 + d_2^2)}{n_1 + n_2}$.",
                        "$\\sigma_1^2 + d_1^2 = 64 + (2.53)^2 = 64 + 6.4009 = 70.4009$.",
