                        "Numerator $= 50(70.4009) + 100(50.6129) = 3520.045 + 5061.29 = 8581.335$.",
                        "$\\sigma^2 = \\frac{8581.335}{150} \\approx 57.21$.",
                        "Combined standard deviation $\\sigma = \\sqrt{57.21} \\approx 7.56$."
